# A deck
// The 52 cards of a standard deck, ace of clubs first.

a "deck" is a list of cards:
	// One of each card, ace of clubs first:  each starts face down, as every two sided view does
	- to create it:
		for each rank in card ranks
			for each suit in card suits
				add a new card with rank = the rank, suit = the suit to the deck
	// Its cards' short names, top to bottom
	- its "state" is:
		set card names to a new list of text
		for each card in the deck
			add the state of the card to card names
		return "deck: " + card names

	- to test a new deck:
		the deck is a new deck
		the number of cards in the deck should be 52
		the number of (cards in the deck where it is a queen) should be 4
		the state of the first card of the deck should be "A♣↓"
		the name of the last card of the deck should be "king of spades"
		shuffle the deck
		the number of cards in the deck should be 52
